# Titanic Survival Prediction Web App

This project uses machine learning to predict survival on the Titanic based on a given set of features.

## Tech Stack

- **Streamlit**: Framework untuk web app
- **Scikit-learn**: Library untuk machine learning
- **Pandas**: Data manipulation
- **Joblib**: Untuk menyimpan model

## Requirements

- Python 3.9
- Streamlit
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- Joblib

